    <bpmn:process id="W_W5171" name="W5171. Third-Party Independent Auditor Engagement &amp; Scope Agreement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Preparation for annual compliance filing; Board Audit Committee request
Frequency: Annual
Volume: 1 audit engagement annually
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Participants: Board Audit Committee, External Environmental Auditor, Procurement (VS-03)
Source: workflow W5171 — Third-Party Independent Auditor Engagement &amp; Scope Agreement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5171_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5171_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5171_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5171_Start3" name="Preparation for annual compliance filing; Board Audit Committee request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5171_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5171_Task4" name="Draft request for proposal (RFP) for accredited independent environmental audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Draft request for proposal (RFP) for accredited independent environmental audit firms.
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5171_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5171_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5171_Task5" name="Evaluate bids: select auditor based on accreditation status with the DENR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Evaluate bids: select auditor based on accreditation status with the DENR, retail experience, and fee structure.
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5171_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5171_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5171_Task6" name="Negotiate engagement letter: define audit scope (footprint calculations, store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Negotiate engagement letter: define audit scope (footprint calculations, store collections, partner log checks, and PRC matching).
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5171_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5171_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5171_Task7" name="Establish audit schedule and coordinate internal resource assignments (real…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Establish audit schedule and coordinate internal resource assignments (real estate, logistics, IT).
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5171_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5171_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5171_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5171_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5171_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-769 (ensure controlled execution — EPR Credit Trading, Compliance Auditing &amp; Annual Reporting (PA-179.3).) | - CTL-769: Auditor selected and approved by Board Audit Committee; scope matching NSWMC parameters.
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Director of Internal Audit (VS-21)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
