      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: NSWMC audit review highlighting program gaps; internal audit identifying compliance risk
Frequency: Annual
Volume: 1 review and remediation plan annually
Owner: Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Participants: EPR Compliance Manager, FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Legal Operations (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5174 — EPR Program Variance Analysis, Penalty Provisioning &amp; Remediation</bpmn:documentation>
