      <bpmn:userTask id="W5174_Task4" name="Conduct variance analysis: identify root causes for any recovery volume…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Conduct variance analysis: identify root causes for any recovery volume shortfalls or compliance failures.
Responsible (R): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Accountable (A): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5174_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5174_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5174_Task5" name="Calculate potential statutory fines and set up accounting provisions in the GL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Calculate potential statutory fines and set up accounting provisions in the GL (VS-17.1) for pending penalties.
Responsible (R): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Accountable (A): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5174_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5174_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5174_Task6" name="Develop the EPR Remediation Plan: identify new recovery partners, negotiate…">
