Responsible (R): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Accountable (A): Director of Internal Audit / Finance Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5174_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5174_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5174_Task7" name="Present remediation plan to the Board Audit Committee and monitor execution…">
