Volume: 2 major campaigns annually
Owner: Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Participants: Sustainability Lead, Marketing team, POS staff, Customer Loyalty (VS-13)
Source: workflow W5175 — Plastic Reduction / Eco-Fulfillment Consumer Marketing Support</bpmn:documentation>
