      <bpmn:userTask id="W5175_Task4" name="Develop green marketing concept: highlight BuildRight&#x27;s plastic recovery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Develop green marketing concept: highlight BuildRight&#x27;s plastic recovery achievements, recycled private label packaging, and eco-friendly products.
Responsible (R): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Accountable (A): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5175_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5175_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5175_Task5" name="Design campaign assets: in-store signage, digital media ads, and loyalty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Design campaign assets: in-store signage, digital media ads, and loyalty program promotions (e.g. double loyalty points for returning plastic containers).
Responsible (R): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Accountable (A): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5175_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
