Responsible (R): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Accountable (A): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5175_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5175_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5175_Task7" name="Track campaign ROI: analyze customer engagement, recycling bin footfall, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Track campaign ROI: analyze customer engagement, recycling bin footfall, and green product sales lift.
Responsible (R): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Accountable (A): Brand &amp; Promotions Manager (VS-14)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5175_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5175_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
