      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly board meetings; annual report preparation (VS-36)
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: 4 reviews annually
Owner: CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Board of Directors, CEO, Corporate Secretary (VS-36), Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W5176 — Board-Level Sustainability/EPR Dashboard &amp; Program Performance Review</bpmn:documentation>
