      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5176_Task4" name="Compile sustainability metrics: plastic footprint tonnage, recovery volumes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compile sustainability metrics: plastic footprint tonnage, recovery volumes, recovery percentage, compliance costs, and audit status.
Responsible (R): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5176_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5176_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5176_Task5" name="Prepare the Board Sustainability Report and configure the executive dashboard.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Prepare the Board Sustainability Report and configure the executive dashboard.
Responsible (R): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5176_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5176_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5176_Task6" name="Present program performance at the quarterly Board meeting; highlight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Present program performance at the quarterly Board meeting; highlight compliance risks, cost trends, and carbon reduction impacts.
Responsible (R): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5176_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5176_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5176_Task7" name="Document Board directives and allocate funds for approved sustainability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Document Board directives and allocate funds for approved sustainability projects.
Responsible (R): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5176_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5176_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5176_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5176_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
